# Gate 0 + --prefix-match-unit 16. Cold Final. Does not claim a score.
# Parent: final-combined #11 S=21.0. Single change: finer prefix match inside
# a hybrid cache block (cold Final hit rate was ~44%). Must divide every cache
# block; if startup rejects it, say so.
# Held from Gate 0: budget 2048, mem 0.95, APC on, MTP off, uncapped,
# chunked prefill, card-default power. No --max-num-seqs, no active-seq cap,
# no BF16 Mamba, no ngram, no FP8 KV.
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.95
--max-model-len 40960
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
--enable-chunked-prefill
--max-num-batched-tokens 2048
--enable-prefix-caching
--prefix-match-unit 16
# --mamba-cache-mode align matches run5/profile.args.
# On vLLM 0.32.1rc1.dev361+g83c078d95, --mamba-cache-mode is deprecated and has no effect.
# Mamba prefix caching follows --enable-prefix-caching.
# flag-check may WARN that "align" is absent from that deprecation text. That WARN is expected.
--mamba-cache-mode align
